  "decision_conditions": [
    "&lt;p&gt;The proposed replacement windows, due to the lack of information demonstrating the need for a replacement, the significance of the glazing to be removed, and the lack of material samples provided to demonstrate these would match the existing, would undermine the established character and appearance of the locally listed terrace at 7–17 London Road and would fail to preserve or enhance the character and appearance of the Sudbury Hill Conservation Area. This would result in harm to both the host property and the wider area. Furthermore, insufficient information has been submitted to enable a comprehensive assessment of the proposal. The proposal is therefore contrary to the high-quality design objectives of the National Planning Policy Framework (2026); Policies D3, (D1, D11, D12) and HC1 of the London Plan (2021); Policies GR1 and HE1 of the Harrow Local Plan (2021–2041); the adopted Supplementary Planning Document: Residential Design Guide (2010); and the adopted Sudbury Hill Estate Conservation Area Appraisal and Management Strategy (2009).&lt;/p&gt;"
